      <Comment source="AU4FS-4, SRI, caspi">|FRAME: CPD-21116|, |FRAME: CPD-21115| and |FRAME: CPD-21109| are the key aroma volatiles in fresh must of Cabernet and Sauvignon grapes and in passion fruit juice |CITS: [Tominaga98][10898639][26227410]|. |FRAME: CPD-21109 3-Sulfanylhexan-1-ol| is also a component of the odorous compounds produced by bacteria acting on axillary (underarm) secretions, although it has been described as possessing a less objectionable, occasionally fruity odour |CITS: [17191898][23278215]|.</Comment>
